### Create Public Channel
POST http://localhost:5000/api/channel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general",
  "description": "General discussion channel",
  "isPrivate": false
}

### Create Private Channel
POST http://localhost:5000/api/channel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "dev-team",
  "description": "Private dev team channel",
  "isPrivate": true
}

### Get All Public Channels
GET http://localhost:5000/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

### Get My Channels
GET http://localhost:5000/api/channels/mine
Content-Type: application/json

### Join Channel
# Replace :id with actual channel ID
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/channel/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010/join
Content-Type: application/json

### Leave Channel
# Replace :id with actual channel ID
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/channel/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010/leave
Content-Type: application/json

### Deactivate Channel (Creator or Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/channel/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isChannelActive": false
}

### Reactivate Channel
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/channel/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isChannelActive": true
}